    "Forget boring manual records. Monitor your cash flow, digital wallets, and investments in one smart dashboard.": "Lupakan catatan manual yang membosankan. Monitor arus kas, dompet digital, dan investasi Anda dalam satu dashboard pintar.",
    "Start Tracking Now": "Mulai Tracking Sekarang",
